-- title:
--   Integral structure of S_k(Γ₀(N)) from the Hecke algebra
-- statement:
--   Let $N \geq 1$ be a natural number and $k$ an integer with $1 \le k$, and let $\mathbb{T}_{\mathbb{Z}} =$ [`CuspForm.heckeAlgebra N k ∅`](def/CuspForm_HeckeAlgebra.html#L18) be the $\mathbb{Z}$-subalgebra of $\operatorname{End}_{\mathbb{C}} S_k(\Gamma_0(N))$ generated by the operators `heckeTLin` attached to the primes $\ell \nmid N$ together with the operators `heckeULin` attached to the primes $q \mid N$ (the excluded set of primes being empty). Assume two hypotheses: first, that $\mathbb{T}_{\mathbb{Z}}$ is a finite $\mathbb{Z}$-module; second, that for every type $\iota$ in the lowest universe and every family $T : \iota \to \mathbb{T}_{\mathbb{Z}}$ which is linearly independent over $\mathbb{Z}$, the family of the corresponding $\mathbb{C}$-linear endomorphisms of $S_k(\Gamma_0(N))$ is linearly independent over $\mathbb{C}$. Then [`CuspForm.HasIntegralStructure N k`](def/CuspForm_IntegralStructure.html#L6) holds: writing $L$ for the $\mathbb{Z}$-submodule of $S_k(\Gamma_0(N))$ spanned by those cusp forms $f$ all of whose $q$-expansion coefficients [`ModularFormClass.qCoeff f n`](def/FLTPrelim_Modularity.html#L19) ($n \in \mathbb{N}$) lie in the image of $\mathbb{Z}$ in $\mathbb{C}$, the $\mathbb{C}$-span of $L$ is all of $S_k(\Gamma_0(N))$. Here $S_k(\Gamma_0(N))$ denotes `CuspForm (CongruenceSubgroup.Gamma0 N) k`.
--
--   This is the statement that the space of cusp forms of weight $k$ on $\Gamma_0(N)$ is spanned over $\mathbb{C}$ by forms with integral $q$-expansions, deduced from two properties of the integral Hecke algebra; the proof cites the formulae for the $q$-expansion coefficients of $T_p f$ and $U_p f$ and the finite-dimensionality of $S_k(\Gamma_0(N))$. It is the reduction step used by [`CuspForm.hasIntegralStructure_of_two_le`](thm.html#CuspForm.hasIntegralStructure_of_two_le), where the two hypotheses are verified for $k \ge 2$.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_CuspForm_hasIntegralStructure_of_moduleFinite_of_linearIndependent.lean

import Definitions.Def_CuspForm_HeckeAlgebra
import Definitions.Def_CuspForm_IntegralStructure

set_option maxHeartbeats 4000000
